  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the rustic charm of the countryside with our Farmhouse Quilt Set from Jeminise. This beautiful quilt set brings a cozy, timeless look to any bedroom, featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics. Perfect for adding warmth and tradition, it's also a thoughtful, personalized gift for loved ones on any occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Elegance:</strong> Features classic farmhouse patterns and soft, natural fabrics for a cozy, timeless bedroom aesthetic.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your preferred size, optional pillowcases, or add a name for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available in Multiple Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), and King (102''x91'').</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved family members.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried without heat for quick drying and lasting fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes 1 Quilt, with 2 Pillowcases available as an optional addition.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from durable and comfortable Polycotton fabric.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Cat Patchwork</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input (for name)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), King (102''x91'')</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
